eight elven blueprints and six sigils in the Unit Design.

    python3 "Claude files/tools/build_elven_arsenal.py" .          apply
    python3 "Claude files/tools/build_elven_arsenal.py" . check    report only

Safe to re-run. The designer options sit between "# BEGIN DA_EL" / "# END DA_EL" markers, first in their event, before
every other builder's block: each builder strips only its own block and puts it back before the next one it knows, so a
re-run of any of them leaves this block where it is. The lines added to DA_Metallurgy_special_mod_effects.txt end with
"# DA_EL" and are added once.

Run order: this builder, then build_secondary_tech.py (Unit Design shows the new parts).

Who
  * Dragonguard Spellforms (all four classes): Spellblades (Evocation II of the Elven page) and the Precursor heritage.
    It takes ordinary blueprints too.
  * The eight blueprints: the design's Primary Technology is Dragonguard Spellforms, their tier's power, and what the
