  * The six sigils (runes, every class): Spellblades, the heritage, and what the table says.

Prices: the rules of build_obsidian_tech.py (guide 08 for blueprints, the rune rule of 11 November for the sigils).
The fixed effects are the library's (DA_Unique_mod.BLUEPRINT / RUNE.<class>.<token>), the same tokens the obsidian set
uses, so their grant, removal and clean-up lines are already there (validate() checks it).
"""
